    M_ICLR          214/218   pend2 rbc (0x10), pend2 rbh (0x10); pendboth rbc (0x10), pendboth rbh (0x10); the T1 writes declined (count 0 by then)
    M_HI            214/218   pend2 rbh (0x20), pend2 huh (1); pendboth rbh (0x20), pendboth huh (1); the T1 writes declined
    M_P1IEN         206/218   pend1 rbi (0x33), rb2i (0x13), rbc (0x10), rbh (0x10), rb2c (0x13), rb2h (0x13);
